    <div id="root"><header class="site-header"><div class="container header-shell"><a class="brand-link" href="/" aria-label="PINMOO 品沐咨询首页"><span class="logo-frame logo-frame-header"><picture><source srcset="/assets/logo-pinmoo-clean.webp" type="image/webp"><img src="/assets/logo-pinmoo-clean.png" alt="PINMOO 品沐咨询 Logo" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='/assets/logo-pinmoo-original.png'"></picture></span></a><nav class="desktop-nav" aria-label="主导航"><a class="" href="/">首页</a><a class="" href="/ai-diagnosis/">电商经营报告</a><a class="active" href="/services/">服务介绍</a><a class="" href="/cases/">案例展示</a><a class="" href="/about/">关于品沐</a><a class="" href="/contact/">联系我们</a><div class="language-switch" aria-label="Language switch"><a class="active" href="/services/">中文</a><a class="" href="/en/services/">EN</a></div></nav><div class="header-actions"><a class="header-cta" href="/contact/">预约咨询</a></div><button class="mobile-menu-btn" type="button" aria-label="打开导航" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16"/></svg></button></div><div class="mobile-nav-panel"><nav aria-label="移动端导航"><a class="" href="/">首页</a><a class="" href="/ai-diagnosis/">电商经营报告</a><a class="active" href="/services/">服务介绍</a><a class="" href="/cases/">案例展示</a><a class="" href="/about/">关于品沐</a><a class="" href="/contact/">联系我们</a><div class="language-switch" aria-label="Language switch"><a class="active" href="/services/">中文</a><a class="" href="/en/services/">EN</a></div><a class="mobile-nav-cta" href="/contact/">预约咨询</a></nav></div></header><main id="main-content"><section class="page-hero "><div class="hero-grid-bg"></div><div class="container page-hero-inner"><div class="reveal"><h1>从诊断到陪跑，帮品牌建立可持续增长路径</h1><p>品沐咨询围绕电商业务中的平台选择、商品结构、内容种草、页面转化、广告投放、直播运营、会员复购等关键环节，为品牌提供诊断、策略、执行陪跑和复盘优化服务